---
import Layout from "../../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Hero from "../../../components/Hero.astro";
import Figure from "../../../components/Figure.astro";
import Icon from "../../../components/Icon.astro";
import { withBase } from "../../../consts";
import kenboxCabinetImg from "../../../assets/photos/shopping-voitures-miniatures.jpg";
import kenboxGarageImg from "../../../assets/photos/tokyo-kenbox-b2f-tomica-garage.jpg";
import libertyWalkImg from "../../../assets/photos/tokyo-liberty-walk-vitrine-miniatures.jpg";

interface ShopAddress {
  eyebrow: string;
  name: string;
  address: string;
}

function mapsHref(shop: ShopAddress) {
  return `https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=${encodeURIComponent(`${shop.name}, ${shop.address}`)}`;
}

const kenBoxShops: ShopAddress[] = [
  {
    eyebrow: "Tomica & detailed models",
    name: "Ken Box",
    address: "MPR3+7C Shinjuku, Tokyo, Japan",
  },
  {
    eyebrow: "Tomica & detailed models",
    name: "Ken Box B2F",
    address: "Japan, 〒160-0022 Tokyo, Shinjuku City, Shinjuku, 3 Chome−33−10 新宿モリエールビル B2",
  },
];

const tomicaShop: ShopAddress = {
  eyebrow: "Customization",
  name: "Tomica Shop Tokyo Character Street",
  address: "Japan, 〒100-0005 Tokyo, Chiyoda City, Marunouchi, 1 Chome−9−1 東京駅一番街 東京キャラクターストリート",
};

const libertyWalk: ShopAddress = {
  eyebrow: "Liberty Walk scale models",
  name: "Liberty Walk",
  address: "4 Chome-26-3 Jingumae, Shibuya, Tokyo 150-0001, Japan",
};
---

<Layout
  title="Scale model shops in Tokyo"
  description="The JDM scale model shops I found in Tokyo: Bic Camera, Ken Box, Tomica Shop Tokyo and the Liberty Walk universe."
>
  <Hero
    eyebrow="Great spot · Tokyo"
    title="Scale model shops"
    subtitle="The stores where you can find JDM scale models in Tokyo, to bring home a collector's souvenir."
    compact
  />

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 pt-10 sm:pt-14 pb-8 sm:pb-10 sm:px-8">
    <a
      href={withBase("/en/tokyo/")}
      class="link-underline reveal inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-body text-sm font-medium text-ink-soft"
    >
      <Icon name="arrow-left" class="h-3.5 w-3.5" />
      Back to Tokyo
    </a>

    <p class="reveal mt-8 font-body text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
      There are lots of scale model shops in Tokyo, in 1/43 as well as 1/64. Some you'll come across without even
      looking, others are definitely worth the detour.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 pb-8 sm:pb-10 sm:px-8">
    <h2 class="reveal font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">Everywhere, without even looking</h2>
    <p class="reveal mt-4 font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
      You can find scale models pretty much everywhere, for example at Bic Camera: there's often a section dedicated
      to Tomica cars and model kits. There are Bic Camera stores all over the city, so no need to plan a special trip,
      just keep your eyes open while you wander around.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 pb-8 sm:pb-10 sm:px-8">
    <h2 class="reveal font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">For collectors: Ken Box and Ken Box B2F</h2>
    <p class="reveal mt-4 font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
      If you're looking for more specialized shops, head to Shinjuku for Ken Box and Ken Box B2F. You'll find Tomica,
      garages and cars far more detailed than anywhere else. A word of warning though: finding your gem can get
      expensive fast, some pieces reach high prices. You can easily go just to browse, or treat yourself if you fall
      in love with something.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-6 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
      {kenBoxShops.map((shop) => (
        <div class="reveal rounded-lg border border-mist-200 bg-paper-dim/40 p-5">
          <p class="eyebrow text-racing-500">{shop.eyebrow}</p>
          <p class="mt-2 font-body text-sm font-semibold text-ink">{shop.name}</p>
          <p class="mt-1 flex items-start gap-1.5 font-body text-sm text-ink-soft">
            <Icon name="map-pin" class="mt-0.5 h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 text-mist-500" />
            {shop.address}
          </p>
          <a
            href={mapsHref(shop)}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="link-underline mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-body text-sm font-medium text-racing-500"
          >
            Open in Google Maps
            <Icon name="external-link" class="h-3.5 w-3.5" />
          </a>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      <Figure
        image={kenboxCabinetImg}
        alt="Display cases of collector scale model cars at Ken Box B2F in Shinjuku"
        caption="A whole wall of display cases at Ken Box B2F."
        class="text-center"
        aspectClass="aspect-[3/4]"
      />
      <Figure
        image={kenboxGarageImg}
        alt="Shelves of Tomica Premium cars and miniature garages at Ken Box B2F"
        caption="Tomica Premium and miniature garages."
        class="text-center"
        aspectClass="aspect-[3/4]"
      />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 pb-8 sm:pb-10 sm:px-8">
    <h2 class="reveal font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">Customize your own model: Tomica Shop Tokyo</h2>
    <p class="reveal mt-4 font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
      Want to really customize your own scale model? Head to the Tomica Shop Tokyo, in the Chiyoda district, inside
      Tokyo Station, on Tokyo Character Street.
    </p>

    <div class="reveal mt-6 rounded-lg border border-mist-200 bg-paper-dim/40 p-5">
      <p class="eyebrow text-racing-500">{tomicaShop.eyebrow}</p>
      <p class="mt-2 font-body text-sm font-semibold text-ink">{tomicaShop.name}</p>
      <p class="mt-1 flex items-start gap-1.5 font-body text-sm text-ink-soft">
        <Icon name="map-pin" class="mt-0.5 h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 text-mist-500" />
        {tomicaShop.address}
      </p>
      <a
        href={mapsHref(tomicaShop)}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="link-underline mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-body text-sm font-medium text-racing-500"
      >
        Open in Google Maps
        <Icon name="external-link" class="h-3.5 w-3.5" />
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 pb-10 sm:pb-14 sm:px-8">
    <h2 class="reveal font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">The Liberty Walk universe</h2>
    <p class="reveal mt-4 font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
      At Liberty Walk, in Shibuya, you can also buy scale models of their creations: F40, RX-7 and other iconic models
      from the brand, from small to very large scale.
    </p>

    <div class="reveal mt-6 rounded-lg border border-mist-200 bg-paper-dim/40 p-5">
      <p class="eyebrow text-racing-500">{libertyWalk.eyebrow}</p>
      <p class="mt-2 font-body text-sm font-semibold text-ink">{libertyWalk.name}</p>
      <p class="mt-1 flex items-start gap-1.5 font-body text-sm text-ink-soft">
        <Icon name="map-pin" class="mt-0.5 h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 text-mist-500" />
        {libertyWalk.address}
      </p>
      <a
        href={mapsHref(libertyWalk)}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="link-underline mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-body text-sm font-medium text-racing-500"
      >
        Open in Google Maps
        <Icon name="external-link" class="h-3.5 w-3.5" />
      </a>
    </div>

    <Figure
      image={libertyWalkImg}
      alt="Display cases of Liberty Walk scale models, from small to very large"
      caption="The Liberty Walk display cases, from small to very large."
      class="mx-auto mt-8 max-w-xs sm:max-w-sm"
    />
  </section>

  <section class="border-t border-mist-200 bg-paper-dim/50 py-10 sm:py-14">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 text-center sm:px-8">
      <a
        href={withBase("/en/tokyo/")}
        class="link-underline reveal inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-body text-sm font-medium text-ink"
      >
        <Icon name="arrow-left" class="h-3.5 w-3.5" />
        Back to all Tokyo spots
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
